                   looking for a file
   IFINDREP  ASM - Search thru array of bytes, replac all instances of a
                   value with another.
   ILOCSTRG  ASM - Searches through memory looking for the nth Pascal-style
                   string
   IMACROS   MAC - General macros. Ideal Mode
   IPARAM    ASM - Returns # / contents of command-line parameters
   IPARSEFN  ASM - Routine that parses a file name into Drive, Path, and File
                   spec
